---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="Accessibility — Nexus Wave Technologies">
  <section class="hero"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">Accessibility</p><h1>Accessibility Statement</h1><p class="lead">We aim to make the website clear, keyboard-friendly, screen-reader-friendly, and usable across devices.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container prose card">
    <h2>Our approach</h2><p>We use semantic HTML, visible focus states, readable layouts, descriptive controls, skip navigation, and responsive design where practical.</p>
    <h2>Assistive technology</h2><p>The website is designed to work with common browser accessibility features and screen readers. Some third-party or browser-generated content may behave differently.</p>
    <h2>Feedback</h2><p>Tell us about an accessibility barrier at <a href="mailto:info@nexusweb.co.in">info@nexusweb.co.in</a>. Please describe the page, the problem, and any assistive technology involved so we can investigate.</p>
  </div></div></section>
</Layout>